    "# Field-gate reproduction\n",
    "This notebook reproduces the frozen Anki field-design analysis reported in the manuscript. Raw review logs are not redistributed because the upstream dataset asks users not to redistribute them publicly.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Frozen design:** benchmark commit \`1053082\`, seed \`20260817\`, 1,000 reduced-information collections, fixed 150-collection full-profile subsample."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "!pip -q install numpy scipy pandas scikit-learn matplotlib pyarrow huggingface_hub hf_xet fsrs-optimizer==6.5.0\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
